        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The first time each round that <strong>Rising Pressure</strong> grants you a Reiatsu Point, you also gain <strong>temporary Hit Points equal to half your level</strong> (minimum 2). They last until the start of your next turn and don't stack with themselves.</p><hr /><p><em>This ties the class's signature engine to its real weakness &mdash; a 10-Hit-Point light-armour frontliner &mdash; and pays out every round of every fight.</em></p>"
